      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Why Is There Air? (1965) is Bill Cosby's third album. It was recorded at the Flamingo Hotel in Las Vegas, Nevada. It won the 1966 Grammy Award for Best Comedy Album.",
